      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do not understand.\n\nAfaik, the method `bta_jv_pm_conn_busy` still exist after this CL and should be call when the flag is off.\n\nPrevious to this CL we call it unconditionally on wear target (since `bluetooth.rfcomm.sysproxy.rx.exit_sniff` is set on wear).\n\nAfter this change we either call `bta_jv_reset_sniff_timer` or **nothing** depending on the flag value.\nThe fact that it call nothing is an issue for me.\n\nAm I missing something ?",
