      "writtenOn": "2024-01-05T05:08:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`Afaik, the method bta_jv_pm_conn_busy still exist after this CL and should be call when the flag is off.`\n\nFirst, you\u0027re right. But `bta_jv_pm_conn_busy ` as for wear target is `a bug`. Details are in the description. So we need to remove `bta_jv_pm_conn_busy` at this point.",
      "parentUuid": "dd1072fd_895c6cd0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1262,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 1266,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "968f84d12ca92fd809aae8c1fe2c4d5c78486c49",
